  - A Python OpenPGP verifier was unavailable from the internal package mirror.
- C++ builds requiring external Bazel rules/toolchains still need suitable Artifactory mirrors or explicit offline repository configuration.

Artifact integrity and release identity are nevertheless strongly established by the exact authoritative SHA-256 match, upstream tag commit, official build metadata, and successful execution of the genuine binary.

